## Controlled blinded test plan

Compare stock-corrected V6 control against LH-01 at constant 6,000 uL concentrate and 20% EdP using two independently prepared complete sets, anonymous codes, AB/BA counterbalancing, equal application mass/substrate, separated sessions, and free description before scoring. Read 0, 5, 30, 120 minutes, 6 hours, and 24 hours. Score collection recognizability separately from overall liking, opening pleasure, transition pleasure, drydown pleasure, re-smell desire, ginger clarity, neroli silk, spatial dimensionality, textural differentiation, intensity, fatigue, muddiness, harshness, soap, cologne, candy, white-floral, and laundry takeover. A pairwise win cannot prove why; run the petal-body omission only if free descriptions implicate it. Null, discordant, intensity-confounded, or preparation-divergent results are `HOLD / NON-INFORMATIVE`.

