## Claim ceiling

This is an inventory-grounded computational experiment design. It has not been compounded or smelled. Arithmetic, parser coverage, OAV, temporal modeling, composite-natural decomposition, and donor gates do not establish good smell, liking, hedonism, target similarity, depth, luxury, three-dimensionality, transitions, diffusion, longevity, stability, safety, or release. `NO COMPOUNDING / NO RELEASE`.
